  <rows>
   <row>
    <surveyls_survey_id><![CDATA[583441]]></surveyls_survey_id>
    <surveyls_policy_error/>
    <surveyls_email_invite_subj><![CDATA[FVD therapeutics guideline – please rate the importance of the outcomes]]></surveyls_email_invite_subj>
    <surveyls_email_invite><![CDATA[<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#3c4245;max-width:620px;"><p>Dear {FIRSTNAME},</p><p>As part of the prioritization of outcomes for the filovirus therapeutics guideline, we have solicited a longlist of outcomes and need your help to define the relative importance of each.</p><p>Please assign each outcome a score from 1 to 9: <strong>1–3</strong> is of limited importance; <strong>4–6</strong> is important; <strong>7–9</strong> is critically important. The most important outcomes are those which are important to patients – you should rate them high. If they are “nice to know” or not likely to impact any decision, you should rate them low. See <a href="https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj-2024-081903">Core GRADE 1: overview of the Core GRADE approach</a> for more details on how these ratings are used.</p><p>The survey takes about 5 minutes. Please reply by [DEADLINE].</p><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 10px 0;"><tr><td bgcolor="#009ADE" style="border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #009ADE;"><a href="@@SURVEYURL@@&newtest=Y" style="display:inline-block;padding:11px 20px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;">Rate the outcomes</a></td></tr></table><p>We will show you a summary of these data at or before the next guideline development group meeting.</p><p>Best wishes,</p><p>Jamie Rylance<br />On behalf of the WHO clinical management team</p></div>]]></surveyls_email_invite>
    <surveyls_email_remind_subj><![CDATA[Reminder – FVD therapeutics guideline: please rate the outcomes]]></surveyls_email_remind_subj>
    <surveyls_email_remind><![CDATA[<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#3c4245;max-width:620px;"><p>Dear {FIRSTNAME},</p><p>This is a reminder that we have not yet received your ratings of the outcomes for the filovirus therapeutics guideline. Your input is needed to define the relative importance of each outcome.</p><p>Please assign each outcome a score from 1 to 9: <strong>1–3</strong> is of limited importance; <strong>4–6</strong> is important; <strong>7–9</strong> is critically important. The most important outcomes are those which are important to patients – you should rate them high. If they are “nice to know” or not likely to impact any decision, you should rate them low. See <a href="https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj-2024-081903">Core GRADE 1: overview of the Core GRADE approach</a> for more details on how these ratings are used.</p><p>The survey takes about 5 minutes. Please reply by [DEADLINE].</p><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 10px 0;"><tr><td bgcolor="#009ADE" style="border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #009ADE;"><a href="@@SURVEYURL@@&newtest=Y" style="display:inline-block;padding:11px 20px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;">Rate the outcomes</a></td></tr></table><p>We will show you a summary of these data at or before the next guideline development group meeting.</p><p>Best wishes,</p><p>Jamie Rylance<br />On behalf of the WHO clinical management team</p></div>]]></surveyls_email_remind>
    <surveyls_email_register_subj><![CDATA[Survey registration confirmation]]></surveyls_email_register_subj>
    <surveyls_email_register><![CDATA[Dear {FIRSTNAME},<br />
<br />
You, or someone using your email address, have registered to participate in an online survey titled {SURVEYNAME}.<br />
<br />
To complete this survey, click on the following URL:<br />
<br />
{SURVEYURL}<br />
<br />
If you have any questions about this survey, or if you did not register to participate and believe this email is in error, please contact {ADMINNAME} at {ADMINEMAIL}.]]></surveyls_email_register>
    <surveyls_email_confirm_subj><![CDATA[Confirmation of your participation in our survey]]></surveyls_email_confirm_subj>
    <surveyls_email_confirm><![CDATA[Dear {FIRSTNAME},<br />
<br />
This email is to confirm that you have completed the survey titled {SURVEYNAME} and your response has been saved. Thank you for participating.<br />
<br />
If you have any further questions about this email, please contact {ADMINNAME} on {ADMINEMAIL}.<br />
<br />
Sincerely,<br />
<br />
{ADMINNAME}]]></surveyls_email_confirm>
    <surveyls_dateformat><![CDATA[9]]></surveyls_dateformat>
    <surveyls_alias/>
    <email_admin_notification_subj><![CDATA[Response submission for survey {SURVEYNAME}]]></email_admin_notification_subj>
    <email_admin_notification><![CDATA[Hello,<br />
<br />
A new response was submitted for your survey '{SURVEYNAME}'.<br />
<br />
Click the following link to see the individual response:<br />
{VIEWRESPONSEURL}<br />
<br />
Click the following link to edit the individual response:<br />
{EDITRESPONSEURL}<br />
<br />
View statistics by clicking here:<br />
{STATISTICSURL}]]></email_admin_notification>
    <email_admin_responses_subj><![CDATA[Response submission for survey {SURVEYNAME} with results]]></email_admin_responses_subj>
    <email_admin_responses><![CDATA[Hello,<br />
<br />
A new response was submitted for your survey '{SURVEYNAME}'.<br />
<br />
Click the following link to see the individual response:<br />
{VIEWRESPONSEURL}<br />
<br />
